SUMMARY:AC/DC PWR/UP POP UP
LOCATION:The Bend Lounge | 129 N. Michigan St. | South Bend\, 46601.
DESCRIPTION:The official AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up is coming to South Bend\, crea
 ting the perfect place for fans to gather and extend the concert experien
 ce around AC/DC’s Notre Dame show.\n\nFree and open to the public\, the
  pop-up brings fans together to explore iconic AC/DC props and photo oppo
 rtunities\, shop exclusive pop-up merchandise and limited South Bend even
 t designs\, and meet up with fellow fans.\n\nThe first 200 fans through t
 he door will receive a free commemorative pop-up poster\, while supplies 
 last.\n\nThe Bend Lounge\n\n129 N. Michigan St.\n\nSouth Bend\, IN 46601\
 n\nSeptember 3: 12 PM–9 PM\n\nSeptember 4: 11 AM–6 PM\n\nFree entry. 
 No concert ticket required.\n\nWebsite: PWRUPTOUR.ACDC.COM\n\nMore Info: 
 https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/ac-dc-pwr-up-pop-up/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/ac-dc-pwr-up-pop-up/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T180000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
