 une 28 – Happy Campers\n- July 5 – Hipposonics\n- July 12 – Mr. Z\n
 - July 19 – Zo Keys Band\n- July 26 – Now & Then\n- August 2 – Alli
 gator Blackbird\n- August 9 – Michiana String Collective\n- August 16 
 – Kennedy Kitchen\n- August 23 – Corey Ronell\n- August 30 – Ray Da
 vis\n- September 6 – Left Side of the Dial\n- September 13 – Memphis 
 Underground\n\nSee you there!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.co
 m/events/seitz-park-summer-concert-series/
