DESCRIPTION:The South Bend Cubs 2026 Bar Crawl will take place on Saturday\
 , September 5th. Gates open at 5:30 p.m. and first pitch is scheduled for
  7:05 p.m.\n\n\nThis limited package includes a ticket to the game\, an e
 xclusive Bar Crawl T-Shirt including all of the bars\, and two drink vouc
 hers for fans 21+.\n\n\n**Important Event Details & Requirements:**\nMUST
  be 21 and over with a valid ID to participate\nBars are able to deny acc
 ess based on posted bar rules\nMust be wearing wristband and/or bar crawl
  t-shirt to enter participating bars free of charge\nDrink responsibly\nS
 hirt and wristband pick up will be at Four Winds Field day of the event\n
 \n\nAssociated Bars:\nSouth Bend Cubs\nManny's\nShamrocks\nBrothers\nCorb
 y's\nCJ's Pub\nBrew Works\nLa Esperanza\nFinnies\n\nMore Info: https://ww
 w.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-bar-crawl/
